# The source of each app prebuilt.sha256 pins whose licence makes the image
# carry it (GPL, MPL): SHA-256, file name, and where app-sources.sh gets it
# (a URL, or "local": put it in $LINEAGE_ROOT/prebuilt-sources/ yourself).
# F-Droid keeps the tarball it built each APK from; those are pinned with
# the digests F-Droid's signed index (index-v2) lists for them. Each goes
# out with the VM image, beside x264-source.tar.gz.
#
# Currencies 1.23.0 (GPL-3.0-or-later), F-Droid build 12300.
7254bfb42c0b8274b2e8e6684341e9cc55d37333e69f325a7a117d6caf7a50b5  de.salomax.currencies_12300_src.tar.gz  https://f-droid.org/repo/de.salomax.currencies_12300_src.tar.gz
# Fossify Notes 1.7.0 (GPL-3.0-only), F-Droid build 13.
c859abd363ebc551c55b165241501c88e484fc09b7892d7c34d2932e60e7f0f3  org.fossify.notes_13_src.tar.gz  https://f-droid.org/repo/org.fossify.notes_13_src.tar.gz
# LibreOffice Viewer 26.2.6.3 (MPL-2.0), F-Droid build 129. About 1 GB: it
# changes only when the app does, so it's the same Aleph object until then.
1d4264ae8b7f68c55124c3f68d38caa3dda31781fcf6f88c7b0a08e091963f1f  org.documentfoundation.libreoffice_129_src.tar.gz  https://f-droid.org/repo/org.documentfoundation.libreoffice_129_src.tar.gz
# Fauxx 0.9.3-virtroid.3 (AGPL-3.0-only): upstream's tree at v0.9.3 with
# apps/fauxx/patches applied, as apps/fauxx/build.sh writes it (git archive of
# the patched commit, which the patches' dates make the same every time).
71446f30982f385ccc4292eb9b64008026ba5baa32868c777a64e06f619e2af5  fauxx-source-0.9.3-virtroid.3.tar.gz  local
